7. GitHub, LinkedIn, and Resume Strategy
GitHub
•	Pin Portfolio, RAG Knowledge Assistant, AI Career Copilot Agent, Multi-Agent Software Modernization Assistant, GenAI Evaluation Toolkit, and one existing strong project.
•	Every repo needs README, screenshots, architecture diagram, setup steps, limitations, security notes, and future improvements.
LinkedIn
Headline: Full Stack LLM Development Associate | GenAI Engineer | Agentic AI & Azure AI | Building Enterprise AI Agents, RAG Systems & Developer Productivity Tools
Post learning notes, mini project breakdowns, architecture diagrams, certification milestones, and practical lessons from RAG/agent projects.
Resume
Add only mature projects. Use impact + tech + outcome format. Example: Built a full-stack RAG Knowledge Assistant using Python, FastAPI, Azure OpenAI, and Azure AI Search to answer questions over uploaded documents with citations and retrieval evaluation.
